    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Pro Uploads Cleaner scans your /uploads folder for unused images and helps you clean them safely.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload plugin files to /wp-content/plugins/pro-uploads-cleaner.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin in WordPress admin.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='will%20this%20delete%20my%20images%20automatically%3F'>\nWill this delete my images automatically?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. The plugin first scans your uploads folder and lists unused images. You choose which ones to delete.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='why%20does%20the%20plugin%20only%20scan%20year-based%20folders%20%28like%202022%2C%202023%29%3F'>\nWhy does the plugin only scan year-based folders (like 2022, 2023)?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>To avoid accidentally deleting files created by other plugins, Pro Uploads Cleaner limits its scan to the standard year-based WordPress media folders (e.g. /uploads/2022/, /uploads/2023/).</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='should%20i%20take%20a%20backup%20before%20cleaning%3F'>\nShould I take a backup before cleaning?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Always take a full site backup before deleting files.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Scan and clean unused images from your WordPress uploads folder safely.",
    "description": "<p>Pro Uploads Cleaner scans your /uploads folder for unused images and helps you clean them safely.</p>\n",
